  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Intersectorality in social and health care: promoting integrated policies for care-dependent older people in Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Impact Scheme provides previous &amp; current Newton grantees with the opportunity to unlock impact from their work &amp; strengthen the profile of the Fund. It is flexible &amp; responsive to in country needs. It is delivered by the British Council with UKRI on behalf of all DPs. Applicants must demonstrate that these are new activities focusing on impact. Scheme beneficiaries will be vulnerable &amp; low-income populations in partner countries. Multiple SDGs addressed, TBC when awards announced.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world</narrative>
  </description>
